{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（8日）早上8時51分，警方接獲沙田道風山路一間獨立屋的姓李（37歲）男住戶報案，指寓所窗戶被撬開，懷疑遭人爆竊。人員到場向李男了解後，相信一塊約值1萬元的玉器、以及一個內有10萬元現金的保險箱不翼而飛。</p><p>警員事後在道風山路一帶搜索，未有發現。案件列作「爆竊」，交由沙田警區刑事調查隊第五隊跟進，暫未有人被捕。資料顯示，現場內有4幢獨立屋，每個單位逾2,000呎。</p><figure><img alt=\"沙田道風山路一獨立屋的窗戶被撬開爆竊，警方在場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260908/1173936038951784448381942.jpeg/MmOaBlNcVkoxpbr52LPBaxgjUUbSJjgLBQjkrS8I5K0\"/><figcaption>沙田道風山路一獨立屋的窗戶被撬開爆竊，警方在場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在附近一帶巡邏。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260908/1173936042038923264057893.jpeg/9V0_GnfGkWxnPh0t5icM83N-Ceo8id8aJfncBQ_53AU\"/><figcaption>警員在附近一帶巡邏。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260908/1173936045440634880592086.jpeg/zJ-pn4JY2gy74WXqcIsp5fiEhausR4bq-M-2rtLPtq4\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為沙田道風山路一獨立屋。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260908/1173936664855187456805639.jpeg/hdz8NptsjicVTTAZh-Qo2g76Zj77OARYGjUbNzA1Gzc\"/><figcaption>現場為沙田道風山路一獨立屋。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在道風山路一帶巡邏。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260908/1173936667891994624847025.jpeg/4PjI1nE6G_UzLWHBscEoR17g7mN2iOrlUYJagnuCWoI\"/><figcaption>警員在道風山路一帶巡邏。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員接報到場。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260908/1173936672132567040285467.jpeg/vGU1jPl3QPj3n_6ZvpYF35cJzaJCzm8JeZuDclObg3I\"/><figcaption>警員接報到場。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員接報到場。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260908/1173936674951270400963215.jpeg/NJgNxQViffFOspxDK4V4i2DEV0TEqX4bSSaQ_GMmkPw\"/><figcaption>警員接報到場。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T14:15:10.803616+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":316,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}